DESCRIPTION:Show us the most boopable snoots!&#128062\; Submit your pet's
  best shots by November 1\, 2026 for a chance to be featured on Instagram
  (https://www.instagram.com/nyufacultyhousing/). Presented by NYU Faculty
  Housing Happenings. Open to the public.Upload up to five (5) images of y
 our pet (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfGRHq5gHuxdsNVYsgmD8hi
 rCjeggqGaSQeuQshSuS6JDm4uw/viewform?usp=dialog) taken in the last year to
  enter the NYU Faculty Housing Pet Photo Contest 2027.&#160\;A valid Gmai
 l or NYU email address required. Each photo must be no larger than 1 MB i
 n size.  Connect with us on Instagram @nyufacultyhousing (https://www.ins
 tagram.com/nyufacultyhousing)  &#128054\; Oliver &#128247\;Tyler
