SUMMARY:DPI Presents: The Object/Photograph: From the Archives of the Dep
 artment of Photography & Imaging
DESCRIPTION:This exhibition owes much to the legacy of Lee D. Witkin.  Le
 e was one of our very first adjunct professors. He was a pioneer galleris
 t and dealer who cherished the handmade artifacts crafted by photographic
  masters.  As you go through the exhibit\, you'll note that many of the m
 ost important works are the result of his generous donations.
