LOCATION:Bobst Library\, 1st Floor\, Atrium\, Bobst Library
SUMMARY:Bobst Library Tour
DESCRIPTION:REGISTRATION IS REQUIRED - space is limited!Come join us for 
 a walking tour of Bobst Library. Attendees will be shown around the build
 ing and introduced to the vast array of library spaces\, services and res
 ources the library has to help you flourish. Find the study space that is
  best suited to you. Learn which floors are best for finding computers an
 d printers. We'll also share a bit of the history of the library and answ
 er any questions you may have about using the library. All students are w
 elcome! Tours will meet in the Atrium of Bobst Library.REGISTRATION IS RE
 QUIRED - space is limited!NYU Libraries is committed to providing reasona
 ble accommodations to individuals with disabilities. If you have an accom
 modation request\, please email lib-reference@nyu.edu. Additionally\, mas
 ks are always welcome on NYU's campuses and facilities.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:REGISTRATION IS REQUIRED - space is limited!
 <br />Come join us for a walking tour of Bobst Library. Attendees will be
  shown around the building and introduced to the vast array of library sp
 aces\, services and resources the library has to help you flourish. Find 
 the study space that is best suited to you. Learn which floors are best f
 or finding computers and printers. We'll also share a bit of the history 
 of the library and answer any questions you may have about using the libr
 ary. All students are welcome! Tours will meet in the Atrium of Bobst Lib
 rary.<br />REGISTRATION IS REQUIRED - space is limited!<br />NYU Librarie
 s is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to individuals with
  disabilities. If you have an accommodation request\, please email lib-re
 ference@nyu.edu. Additionally\, masks are always welcome on NYU's campuse
 s and facilities.
