SUMMARY:Junior Year Kickoff
DESCRIPTION:Hey Juniors!It's time to kick off our year together! Join us 
 on Friday\, October 9\, from 2:00 to 4:00PM for an afternoon filled with 
 free food\, karaoke\, games\, and a raffle with prizes. Don't miss out on
  the chance to win prizes like a projector or portable speaker!&#160\;We'
 re excited to have you spend time with your classmates\, meet new people\
 , and enjoy an afternoon together. Be sure to stop by and grab some food 
 and win prizes while supplies last!Hosted by: CAS Student Council\, CAS C
 lass of 2028Additional Information can be found at: https://engage.nyu.ed
 u/event/12845413 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12845413)
