SUMMARY:One Minute in New York Pollo AI × GenART NYU
DESCRIPTION:&#160\;What could happen in a New York minute?Pollo AI's glob
 al One Minute creator series starts in New York.Join filmmakers\, visual 
 artists\, designers\, AI creators\, and creative technologists for an aft
 ernoon of creator talks\, hands-on AI filmmaking\, live creation\, and ne
 tworking at NYU.Explore new AI-powered visual storytelling workflows with
  Pollo AI—and create your own New York-inspired concept\, key visual\, 
 or cinematic scene.New York is the first stop. London\, Germany\, and mor
 e cities are next.Event DetailsFriday\, October 9\, 20262:00–5:00 PM4th
  Floor\, 370 Jay St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11201Reservation requiredEvent Agenda
 2:00 PM · Check-in &amp\; Open NetworkingMeet NYC creators\, AI practiti
 oners\, and community partners.2:30 PM · One Minute Launch &amp\; Creato
 r SessionGet an introduction to the global One Minute series and online c
 reator challenge. A featured creator will share their cinematic process\,
  selected work\, Pollo AI workflow\, and practical techniques.3:00 PM · 
 Hands-on Pollo AI ExperienceExplore Pollo AI's image and video creation w
 orkflow with guidance from mentors. Create a New York-inspired concept\, 
 key visual\, or short cinematic scene.3:30 PM · Creator Showcase &amp\; 
 FeedbackSelected participants and teams will present their work and recei
 ve feedback from mentors.4:00 PM · Creator NetworkingConnect with fellow
  creators\, GenART NYU members\, and AI industry professionals.5:00 PM ·
  Event Ends — Online Creation ContinuesCreator Benefits500 Bonus Pollo 
 AI CreditsEveryone who checks in and participates in the hands-on session
  will receive 500 exclusive event credits.Participants can also join the 
 global online creator challenge and receive an additional 800 challenge c
 redits.Pollo AI U.S. Brand Ambassador &amp\; Internship OpportunitiesOuts
 tanding participants may be considered for future U.S. Brand Ambassador a
 nd related internship opportunities across creator community\, content\, 
 and brand initiatives.Global Challenge Grand PrizeThe global One Minute o
 nline creator challenge launches alongside the New York event.In addition
  to creator credits\, global exposure\, and community recognition\, the g
 lobal first-place winner will receive a special grand prize: the latest i
 Phone Duo.Full challenge themes\, rules\, and prize details will be annou
 nced at launch.Who Should Apply?Filmmakers and video creatorsVisual artis
 ts\, animators\, and designersAI creators and creative technologistsStude
 nts and emerging creators exploring AI videoAnyone interested in cinemati
 c storytelling\, short-form filmmaking\, and new creative toolsNo advance
 d AI experience is required. We're looking for people who are curious\, c
 reative\, and ready to make something.Campus AccessNon-NYU guests must re
 gister using their full legal name exactly as it appears on their governm
 ent-issued ID and bring a valid photo ID on the day of the event.What cou
 ld happen in a New York minute?#OneMinuteInNewYork #PolloAI #GenARTNYUHos
 ted by: GenARTAdditional Information can be found at: https://engage.nyu.
 edu/event/12789721 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12789721)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:&#160\;<br />What could happen in a New York
  minute?<br />Pollo AI's global One Minute creator series starts in New Y
 ork.<br />Join filmmakers\, visual artists\, designers\, AI creators\, an
 d creative technologists for an afternoon of creator talks\, hands-on AI 
 filmmaking\, live creation\, and networking at NYU.<br />Explore new AI-p
 owered visual storytelling workflows with Pollo AI—and create your own 
 New York-inspired concept\, key visual\, or cinematic scene.<br />New Yor
 k is the first stop. London\, Germany\, and more cities are next.<br />Ev
 ent Details<br />Friday\, October 9\, 20262:00–5:00 PM4th Floor\, 370 J
 ay St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11201<br />Reservation required<br />Event Agenda<b
 r />2:00 PM · Check-in &amp\; Open NetworkingMeet NYC creators\, AI prac
 titioners\, and community partners.<br />2:30 PM · One Minute Launch &am
 p\; Creator SessionGet an introduction to the global One Minute series an
 d online creator challenge. A featured creator will share their cinematic
  process\, selected work\, Pollo AI workflow\, and practical techniques.<
 br />3:00 PM · Hands-on Pollo AI ExperienceExplore Pollo AI's image and 
 video creation workflow with guidance from mentors. Create a New York-ins
 pired concept\, key visual\, or short cinematic scene.<br />3:30 PM · Cr
 eator Showcase &amp\; FeedbackSelected participants and teams will presen
 t their work and receive feedback from mentors.<br />4:00 PM · Creator N
 etworkingConnect with fellow creators\, GenART NYU members\, and AI indus
 try professionals.<br />5:00 PM · Event Ends — Online Creation Continu
 es<br />Creator Benefits<br />500 Bonus Pollo AI Credits<br />Everyone wh
 o checks in and participates in the hands-on session will receive 500 exc
 lusive event credits.<br />Participants can also join the global online c
 reator challenge and receive an additional 800 challenge credits.<br />Po
 llo AI U.S. Brand Ambassador &amp\; Internship Opportunities<br />Outstan
 ding participants may be considered for future U.S. Brand Ambassador and 
 related internship opportunities across creator community\, content\, and
  brand initiatives.<br />Global Challenge Grand Prize<br />The global One
  Minute online creator challenge launches alongside the New York event.<b
 r />In addition to creator credits\, global exposure\, and community reco
 gnition\, the global first-place winner will receive a special grand priz
 e: the latest iPhone Duo.<br />Full challenge themes\, rules\, and prize 
 details will be announced at launch.<br />Who Should Apply?<br />Filmmake
 rs and video creators<br />Visual artists\, animators\, and designers<br 
 />AI creators and creative technologists<br />Students and emerging creat
 ors exploring AI video<br />Anyone interested in cinematic storytelling\,
  short-form filmmaking\, and new creative tools<br />No advanced AI exper
 ience is required. We're looking for people who are curious\, creative\, 
 and ready to make something.<br />Campus Access<br />Non-NYU guests must 
 register using their full legal name exactly as it appears on their gover
 nment-issued ID and bring a valid photo ID on the day of the event.<br />
 What could happen in a New York minute?<br />#OneMinuteInNewYork #PolloAI
  #GenARTNYU<br />Hosted by: GenART<br />Additional Information can be fou
 nd at: <a href="https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12789721" target="_blank">ht
 tps://engage.nyu.edu/event/12789721</a>
