LOCATION:Bobst Library\, 1st Floor\, Atrium\, Bobst Library
SUMMARY:Introduction to Conservation at NYU Libraries
DESCRIPTION:REGISTRATION IS REQUIRED - space is limited!Ever wonder how f
 ragile books and artifacts survive for centuries? Or who cares for the co
 llections at NYU Libraries? Visit the Barbara Goldsmith Book and Paper Co
 nservation Laboratory to find out. Meet our expert Special Collections Co
 nservators and see how we physically preserve history.REGISTRATION IS REQ
 UIRED - space is limited!NYU Libraries is committed to providing reasonab
 le accommodations to individuals with disabilities. If you have an accomm
 odation request\, please email lib-reference@nyu.edu. Additionally\, mask
 s are always welcome on NYU's campuses and facilities.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:REGISTRATION IS REQUIRED - space is limited!
 <br />Ever wonder how fragile books and artifacts survive for centuries? 
 Or who cares for the collections at NYU Libraries? Visit the Barbara Gold
 smith Book and Paper Conservation Laboratory to find out. Meet our expert
  Special Collections Conservators and see how we physically preserve hist
 ory.<br />REGISTRATION IS REQUIRED - space is limited!<br />NYU Libraries
  is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to individuals with 
 disabilities. If you have an accommodation request\, please email lib-ref
 erence@nyu.edu. Additionally\, masks are always welcome on NYU's campuses
  and facilities.
