  weekly K-pop dance class open to all NYU students! Whether you're an exp
 erienced dancer or trying K-pop choreography for the first time\, everyon
 e is welcome—no prior dance experience required. We alternate between b
 oy-group and girl-group choreography each week\, so there's always someth
 ing new to learn!<br />Classes are limited to 50 participants. Once capac
 ity is reached\, additional attendees may join an in-person waitlist and 
 will be admitted if space becomes available.<br />Follow us on Instagram 
 at @knesisnyu for weekly class songs\, dance covers\, and club updates.<b
 r />Hosted by: K-Nesis - All-University<br />Additional Information can b
