SUMMARY:Game Night Social
DESCRIPTION:Come out and join The Games 4 Learning Student Association fo
 r our first ever game night! We'll have a large variety of board games an
 d puzzles to play\, classic party games like Mario Kart and Overcooked\, 
 as well as some recent thesis projects made by NYU students! Support your
  game developers by playtesting their games\, hang out with new people fr
 om different programs\, and potentially meet your future teammates for an
  upcoming ed game jam (more information to come)! We love supporting up a
 nd coming new games\, both digital and analog\, and so if you're currentl
 y making a game and would like to be featured\, please email us using the
  links attached to this organization.&#160\;Light refreshments and snacks
  will be provided. We hope to see you there!Hosted by: Games 4 Learning S
 tudent AssociationAdditional Information can be found at: https://engage.
 nyu.edu/event/12871436 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12871436)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Come out and join The Games 4 Learning Stude
 nt Association for our first ever game night! We'll have a large variety 
 of board games and puzzles to play\, classic party games like Mario Kart 
 and Overcooked\, as well as some recent thesis projects made by NYU stude
 nts! Support your game developers by playtesting their games\, hang out w
 ith new people from different programs\, and potentially meet your future
  teammates for an upcoming ed game jam (more information to come)! We lov
 e supporting up and coming new games\, both digital and analog\, and so i
 f you're currently making a game and would like to be featured\, please e
 mail us using the links attached to this organization.&#160\;<br />Light 
 refreshments and snacks will be provided. We hope to see you there!<br />
 Hosted by: Games 4 Learning Student Association<br />Additional Informati
 on can be found at: <a href="https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12871436" targe
 t="_blank">https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12871436</a>
