SUMMARY:Inside Esports: A Fireside Chat with Gen.G CEO Arnold Hur
DESCRIPTION:Join NYU Violet OP for a fireside chat with Arnold Hur\, CEO 
 of Gen.G\, exploring esports careers and the business of gaming. Hear abo
 ut the industry behind competitive play and bring your questions for a st
 udent Q&amp\;A following the conversation.Whether you're an esports fan\,
  interested in a career in gaming\, or curious about the business behind 
 it\, come connect with fellow students and learn from an industry leader.
 Here's the event page with the details and registration.Hosted by NYU VOP
 Hosted by: NYU Campus Recreation\, Tech at NYU - All-UniversityAdditional
  Information can be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12868002 (http
 s://engage.nyu.edu/event/12868002)
