 , share our vision for doing good\, and welcome both new and returning st
 udents! This will be a relaxed evening with dinner\, conversations\, and 
 a chance to connect with like-minded people interested in making a positi
 ve impact. Find more information about EA NYU and&#160\;pre-registrer for
  the talk here!&#160\;&#160\;Date: Friday\, October 9\, 2026Time: 6-8 PMH
 osted by: Effective Altruism at NYU - All-UniversityAdditional Informatio
 n can be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12842051 (https://engage.
 nyu.edu/event/12842051)
