SUMMARY:SITM x CLIVE LIVE: Open Mic
DESCRIPTION:She Is The Music is partnering with Clive Live to host a comm
 unity hangout and open mic at The Garage on October 9. The event is inten
 ded to bring together artists\, songwriters\, producers\, musicians\, and
  other creatives in a casual and social environment.While the open mic wi
 ll serve as the main programming element\, the event will be positioned a
 s a broader community hangout rather than solely a performance event. The
  goal is to create opportunities for attendees to network\, meet potentia
 l collaborators\, and engage with the SITM and Clive Live communities.Add
 itional activations such as a collaboration/matchmaking board\, Polaroid 
 wall\, conversation prompts\, food and drinks\, and a SITM area will help
  encourage interaction throughout the event and between performances.Host
 ed by: She is The Music at NYU - All-UniversityAdditional Information can
  be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12835994 (https://engage.nyu.e
 du/event/12835994)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:She Is The Music is partnering with Clive Li
 ve to host a community hangout and open mic at The Garage on October 9. T
 he event is intended to bring together artists\, songwriters\, producers\
 , musicians\, and other creatives in a casual and social environment.<br 
 />While the open mic will serve as the main programming element\, the eve
 nt will be positioned as a broader community hangout rather than solely a
  performance event. The goal is to create opportunities for attendees to 
 network\, meet potential collaborators\, and engage with the SITM and Cli
 ve Live communities.Additional activations such as a collaboration/matchm
 aking board\, Polaroid wall\, conversation prompts\, food and drinks\, an
 d a SITM area will help encourage interaction throughout the event and be
 tween performances.<br /><br />Hosted by: She is The Music at NYU - All-U
 niversity<br />Additional Information can be found at: <a href="https://e
 ngage.nyu.edu/event/12835994" target="_blank">https://engage.nyu.edu/even
 t/12835994</a>
