 r. Dinner is provided\, so come hungry.  Whether you're new to faith\, ju
 st curious\, or looking for a consistent place to connect and be renewed\
 , all are welcome.  When: Friday\, 7:00 PM  Where: GCASL Lounge (491)  Wh
 at to expect: Bible study\, discussion\, and a free dinner  RSVP: Mikayla
  Spivey '28 — mls9923@nyu.edu  Follow us on IG @cknyu for the latest in
 fo\, including potential last minute room changes!Located at Global Cente
 r for Academic and Spiritual Life\, GSL 491
