SUMMARY:Yoga for Every Body with Amy Coombs
DESCRIPTION:https://nyu.zoom.us/j/98339675531 (https://nyu.zoom.us/j/9833
 9675531)&#160\;  A well-rounded\, all-level yoga class that meets each pr
 actitioner where they are. Good for beginners who want to learn proper al
 ignment and great for advanced practitioners to challenge themselves in n
 ew ways. Variations on poses will be offered\, and students will be promp
 ted to reflect on their own energies and tendencies\, fostering greater s
 elf-awareness off the mat. A wind-down that includes either Yoga Nidra\, 
 Meditation\, or Pranayama will be included for deep relaxation and a clea
 rer mind.  Located at 238 Thompson Street (GCASL)\, Room 461 [Hybrid]
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><a href="https://nyu.zoom.us/j/9833967553
 1">https://nyu.zoom.us/j/98339675531</a>&#160\;</p><p>  A well-rounded\, 
 all-level yoga class that meets each practitioner where they are. Good fo
 r beginners who want to learn proper alignment and great for advanced pra
 ctitioners to challenge themselves in new ways. Variations on poses will 
 be offered\, and students will be prompted to reflect on their own energi
 es and tendencies\, fostering greater self-awareness off the mat. A wind-
 down that includes either Yoga Nidra\, Meditation\, or Pranayama will be 
 included for deep relaxation and a clearer mind.</p><p>  Located at 238 T
 hompson Street (GCASL)\, Room 461 [Hybrid]</p>
