DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261013T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261013T130000
LOCATION:6MTC Rm. 200
SUMMARY:Risk Management in Modern Finance: Insights from BNP Paribas
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an in-depth conversation on risk management in to
 day's financial landscape with Andres Torres\, Director of Prime Brokerag
 e Risk at BNP Paribas. Drawing on his extensive experience spanning Goldm
 an Sachs and BNP Paribas\, Andres will explore the critical role of risk 
 management in prime brokerage operations\, real-world challenges in finan
 cial risk\, and the career trajectories of professionals in this field. T
