SUMMARY:Paws For a Cause!
DESCRIPTION:&#160\;Join us for Paws for a Cause\, in partnership with Pro
 ject Canis! From October 5-9\, we'll be collecting clean\, old T-shirts i
 n donation bins on the 2nd floor of 25 W 4th\, with additional donation l
 ocations to come. Then\, on Tuesday\, October 13\, from 4- 6 p.m.\, join 
 us to turn the donated T-shirts into handmade toys for dogs in animal she
 lters. No experience is needed\, and all materials will be provided. Stop
  by\, bring a friend\, make some dog toys\, and enjoy snacks and drinks w
 hile giving back to shelter animals. All NYU students are welcome! We hop
 e to see you there!Hosted by: CAS Student CouncilAdditional Information c
 an be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12839338 (https://engage.nyu
 .edu/event/12839338)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:&#160\;Join us for Paws for a Cause\, in par
 tnership with Project Canis! From October 5-9\, we'll be collecting clean
 \, old T-shirts in donation bins on the 2nd floor of 25 W 4th\, with addi
 tional donation locations to come. Then\, on Tuesday\, October 13\, from 
 4- 6 p.m.\, join us to turn the donated T-shirts into handmade toys for d
 ogs in animal shelters. No experience is needed\, and all materials will 
 be provided. Stop by\, bring a friend\, make some dog toys\, and enjoy sn
 acks and drinks while giving back to shelter animals. All NYU students ar
 e welcome! We hope to see you there!<br />Hosted by: CAS Student Council<
 br />Additional Information can be found at: <a href="https://engage.nyu.
