SUMMARY:Undergraduate Programs Virtual Information Session 2
DESCRIPTION:Join us online to explore the undergraduate programs at NYU R
 ory Meyers College of Nursing. In this session\, we'll cover our four bac
 calaureate degree pathways\, the application process\, admission requirem
 ents\, and scholarship opportunities.Led by the Assistant Director of Und
 ergraduate Admissions\, these information sessions provide an important o
 pportunity to ask questions about the program\, the profession\, and the 
 general student experience at NYU.We hope you will join us!&#160\;Please 
 do not hesitate to contact our office if you have any questions or concer
 ns at nursing.ug.admissions@nyu.edu&#160\;https://nursing.nyu.edu/news/ev
 ents/undergraduate-programs-virtual-information-session-2 (https://nursin
 g.nyu.edu/news/events/undergraduate-programs-virtual-information-session-
 2)
