SUMMARY:Politics Faculty Panel
DESCRIPTION:Join the International Relations Society for a Politics Facul
 ty Panel with four members of NYU's Politics Department: Michael Gilligan
 \, Vlad Lupan\, Steven Brams\, and Alastair Smith. Each brings a differen
 t perspective from within the department\, so you'll get a deeper underst
 anding of the global trends shaping the world right now from several angl
 es\, not just one.The moderated panel will be followed by a Q&amp\;A sess
 ion\, so come ready with your questions. It's a great way to get to know 
 faculty outside the classroom and meet other students who care about inte
 rnational affairs. Open to everyone\, and feel free to bring a friend!Hos
 ted by: International Relations SocietyAdditional Information can be foun
 d at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12866724 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event
 /12866724)
