SUMMARY:Finding Your Fit: Career Without Compromise
DESCRIPTION:How can you tell if a workplace is truly inclusive? What shou
 ld you look for beyond the job description? As part of the LGBTQ+ Center'
 s Career Series\, join the LGBTQ+ Center and the Wasserman Career Center 
 for a conversation about identifying job opportunities that align with yo
 ur values and finding workplaces where you can thrive. This discussion wi
 ll center LGBTQ+ experiences\, but all students are welcome and encourage
 d to participate.  **Note on Inclusion and Accessibility: Our events and 
 initiatives are open to all backgrounds and identities. It is a priority 
 to make our events inclusive and accessible. For any questions or to noti
 fy us of a request\, please email lgbtq@nyu.edu (http://nyu.edu) at least
  72 hours before the event.**
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  How can you tell if a workplace is trul
 y inclusive? What should you look for beyond the job description? As part
  of the LGBTQ+ Center's Career Series\, join the LGBTQ+ Center and the Wa
 sserman Career Center for a conversation about identifying job opportunit
 ies that align with your values and finding workplaces where you can thri
 ve. This discussion will center LGBTQ+ experiences\, but all students are
  welcome and encouraged to participate.</p><p>  **<em><strong>Note on Inc
 lusion and Accessibility</strong>: Our events and initiatives are open to
  all backgrounds and identities. It is a priority to make our events incl
 usive and accessible. For any questions or to notify us of a request\, pl
 ease email lgbtq@<a href="http://nyu.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener n
 ofollow noreferrer">nyu.edu</a> at least 72 hours before the event.</em>*
 *</p>
