 ractical advice for students interested in opportunities in tech and rela
 ted fields.Following the sharing session\, attendees will also have the o
 pportunity to participate in an informal coffee chat\, where you can conn
 ect directly with the speakers\, ask questions\, and learn more about the
 ir experiences at TikTok.Whether you are exploring internship opportuniti
 es\, preparing for recruiting\, or simply interested in learning more abo
 ut the industry\, this is a great chance to gain valuable insights and ex
 pand your professional network.Hosted by: Chinese Students &amp\; Scholar
 s Association - TandonAdditional Information can be found at: https://eng
 age.nyu.edu/event/12844830 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12844830)
