SUMMARY:EDG Ludovica Ciasullo Fireside Chat
DESCRIPTION:Join EDG for a moderated discussion with Dr. Ciasullo on econ
 omic consulting\, applied economic research\, antitrust\, and career oppo
 rtunities in economics\, followed by a student Q&amp\;A.Dr. Ciasullo is c
 urrently an Associate at Cornerstone Research\, an economic and financial
  consulting firm specializing in litigation and regulatory matters. She h
 olds a Ph.D. in Economics from NYU\, with research experience in labor ec
 onomics\, organizational economics\, and microeconomic theory.Location: U
 C-24Hosted by: Economic Development GroupAdditional Information can be fo
