SUMMARY:Sabor y Salud: Celebrating Culture Through Nutrition
DESCRIPTION:In celebration of Hispanic Heritage Month\, join the Latino P
 re-Health Society for Sabor y Salud\, an event highlighting the connectio
 n between nutrition\, culture\, and traditional foods across Latino commu
 nities. We'll explore the nutritional value of familiar cultural foods an
 d discuss how traditional ingredients and meals can contribute to a balan
 ced diet. Come celebrate Hispanic heritage while learning more about the 
 important role that culture plays in nutrition and overall health!Hosted 
 by: Latino Pre-Health SocietyAdditional Information can be found at: http
 s://engage.nyu.edu/event/12870266 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12870266)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:In celebration of Hispanic Heritage Month\, 
 join the Latino Pre-Health Society for Sabor y Salud\, an event highlight
 ing the connection between nutrition\, culture\, and traditional foods ac
 ross Latino communities. We'll explore the nutritional value of familiar 
 cultural foods and discuss how traditional ingredients and meals can cont
 ribute to a balanced diet. Come celebrate Hispanic heritage while learnin
 g more about the important role that culture plays in nutrition and overa
 ll health!<br />Hosted by: Latino Pre-Health Society<br />Additional Info
 rmation can be found at: <a href="https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12870266" 
 target="_blank">https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12870266</a>
