SUMMARY:Tuesday Small Group
DESCRIPTION:Each Tuesday we gather in a relaxed setting with snacks\, fun
  games\, and meaningful Bible study. We start by hanging out\, having sna
 cks and playing a few lighthearted games to build community\, and then di
 ve into Scripture through open discussion\, reflection\, and prayer. It's
  a place where questions are welcome\, friendships deepen\, and faith bec
 omes personal. Whether you've been walking with God for years or you're j
 ust curious\, small group is a space to belong.Hosted by: Asian American 
 Christian Fellowship - All-UniversityAdditional Information can be found 
 at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12856947 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/1
 2856947)
