SUMMARY:Dean's Council Dinner Auditions
DESCRIPTION:We are seeking talented student performers for the Dean's Cou
 ncil Dinner. Whether you dance\, sing\, or play an instrument\, this is y
 our opportunity to perform for the NYU Meyers community. Sign up to secur
 e an audition spot!Note: You must be able to attend the Dean's Council Di
