SUMMARY:Tandon National Coming Out Day 2026
DESCRIPTION:Hello Tandon! Join the Office of Student Leadership and Engag
 ement for National Coming Out Day!Join us in celebrating in the Makerspac
 e Foyer from 1:00 PM - 3:00 PM Wednesday\, October 14\, 2026! We will hav
 e fun activities as well as a space to highlight LGBTQ+ individuals who h
 ave impacted your lives.More on National Coming Out Day:National Coming O
 ut Day was first observed on October 11\, 1988\, on the anniversary of th
 e National March on Washington for Lesbian and Gay Rights as a reminder t
 hat one of our most basic tools is the power of coming out.* (Human Right
 s Campaign)*Remember Coming Out is an individual and personal experience.
  Each person comes out in their own time &amp\; no one can tell someone w
 hen and how to come out.Hosted by:Additional Information can be found at:
  https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12841878 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/1284
 1878)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Hello Tandon! Join the Office of Student Lea
 dership and Engagement for National Coming Out Day!<br />Join us in celeb
 rating in the Makerspace Foyer from 1:00 PM - 3:00 PM Wednesday\, October
  14\, 2026! We will have fun activities as well as a space to highlight L
 GBTQ+ individuals who have impacted your lives.<br />More on National Com
 ing Out Day:National Coming Out Day was first observed on October 11\, 19
 88\, on the anniversary of the National March on Washington for Lesbian a
 nd Gay Rights as a reminder that one of our most basic tools is the power
  of coming out.* (Human Rights Campaign)<br />*Remember Coming Out is an 
 individual and personal experience. Each person comes out in their own ti
 me &amp\; no one can tell someone when and how to come out.<br />Hosted b
 y:<br />Additional Information can be found at: <a href="https://engage.n
 yu.edu/event/12841878" target="_blank">https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12841
 878</a>
