SUMMARY:NYU PDS: Magnification in Dentistry with Dr. Tony Wu\, DDS
DESCRIPTION:Join the NYU Pre-Dental Society for an evening with Dr. Tony 
 Wu\, DDS\, a general dentist and NYUCD faculty advisor\, as he discusses 
 magnification in dentistry and its role in precision\, posture\, and back
  pain prevention.The event will wrap up with a hands-on indirect vision e
 xercise\, where students can use dental mirrors and practice sheets to de
 velop their indirect vision.Hosted by: Pre-Dental SocietyAdditional Infor
 mation can be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12794142 (https://en
 gage.nyu.edu/event/12794142)
