SUMMARY:Chess Club Weekly Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to NYU's one and only Chess Club! Look out for our we
 ekly email reminders\, and join our discord&#160\;HERE.Our meetings consi
 st of both casual teaching and playing\, including friendly competitions!
  Come develop your skills\, meet and play fellow chess enthusiasts\, and 
 eat free pizza!We have members of all skill levels and encourage all to j
 oin! We're a super chill\, low-pressure environment (though\, for the mor
 e skilled players\, we can promise that you'll meet your match (or perhap
 s better) here\, too).If you have any questions or ideas for future chess
  meetings\, please let us know! Hope to see you there :)Hosted by: Chess 
 Club - All-University\, Chess Team - All-UniversityAdditional Information
  can be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12772270 (https://engage.n
 yu.edu/event/12772270)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Welcome to NYU's one and only Chess Club! Lo
 ok out for our weekly email reminders\, and join our discord&#160\;HERE.<
 br />Our meetings consist of both casual teaching and playing\, including
  friendly competitions! Come develop your skills\, meet and play fellow c
 hess enthusiasts\, and eat free pizza!<br />We have members of all skill 
 levels and encourage all to join! We're a super chill\, low-pressure envi
 ronment (though\, for the more skilled players\, we can promise that you'
 ll meet your match (or perhaps better) here\, too).<br />If you have any 
 questions or ideas for future chess meetings\, please let us know! Hope t
 o see you there :)<br />Hosted by: Chess Club - All-University\, Chess Te
 am - All-University<br />Additional Information can be found at: <a href=
 "https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12772270" target="_blank">https://engage.ny
 u.edu/event/12772270</a>
