DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261014T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261014T200000
LOCATION:Education Building (6th floor Conference Room)
GEO:40.72943;-73.99603
SUMMARY:MuSE::A Fourier explanation of AI-music artifacts
DESCRIPTION:Research paper reading led by Jeff Gordon\, MS Data Science: 
 "A Fourier Explanation of AI-music Artifacts" by Darius Afchar\, Gabriel 
 Meseguer-Brocal\, Kamil Akesbi and Romain Hennequin.​Tools like Suno an
 d Udio can generate a full song from a text prompt. Is there anything in 
 the sound itself that shows a song was generated? Jeff walks through a pa
 per that looks for the answer in how these models build audio and in the 
 frequencies that end up in the result. No background needed. Reading and 
 discussion\, open to all NYU students.​For those who aren't NYU-affilia
 tes or won't be able to make it in person\, please join us online:​http
 s://nyu.zoom.us/j/96543996147Hosted by: Generative Audio &amp\; AI at NYU
  - All-UniversityOnline Location: ​https://nyu.zoom.us/j/96543996147Add
 itional Information can be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/1286685
 2 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12866852)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Research paper reading led by Jeff Gordon\, 
 MS Data Science: "A Fourier Explanation of AI-music Artifacts" by Darius 
 Afchar\, Gabriel Meseguer-Brocal\, Kamil Akesbi and Romain Hennequin.<br 
 />​Tools like Suno and Udio can generate a full song from a text prompt
 . Is there anything in the sound itself that shows a song was generated? 
 Jeff walks through a paper that looks for the answer in how these models 
 build audio and in the frequencies that end up in the result. No backgrou
 nd needed. Reading and discussion\, open to all NYU students.<br />​For
  those who aren't NYU-affiliates or won't be able to make it in person\, 
 please join us online:​https://nyu.zoom.us/j/96543996147<br />Hosted by
 : Generative Audio &amp\; AI at NYU - All-University<br />Online Location
 : ​https://nyu.zoom.us/j/96543996147<br />Additional Information can be
  found at: <a href="https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12866852" target="_blank
 ">https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12866852</a>
