SUMMARY:30 Minute Lightning Lesson: Navigating the Library Catalog like a
  Pro
DESCRIPTION:You've been told to use the "library catalog"\, but what does
  that even mean? In this lightning session\, you will be introduced to th
 e digital interfaces that make up the library catalog and learn a handful
  of quick tips for navigating catalog features to make searching and acce
 ssing materials easier!This workshop will be held via Zoom. The link will
  be sent to registrants before the session. This session WILL NOT be reco
 rded.NYU Libraries is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to
  individuals with disabilities. If you have an accommodation request\, pl
 ease email lib-reference@nyu.edu. Additionally\, masks are always welcome
  on NYU's campuses and facilities.
