  from alumni and current EMPA students working across advocacy and politi
 cal action\, including community organizing\, policy\, and campaign strat
 egy. Panelists will reflect on their career paths since graduating\, shar
 e how their time at Wagner shaped their trajectories\, and offer insights
  into navigating different roles and sectors within the field. Students w
 ill gain a clearer understanding of the diverse pathways into advocacy\, 
 the skills needed to succeed\, and how to strategically use their time at
  Wagner to prepare for impactful careers in public service.RSVP: https://
