SUMMARY:Take Action! Nonpartisan Letter Writing for November's Election
DESCRIPTION:Join the Changemaker Center in writing postcards to voters fo
 r the upcoming midterm elections! We're partnering with Voteriders\, a no
 npartisan organization whose goal is to ensure voters know the deadlines 
 for voter registration\, when and where to go to the polls\, and what the
 y need to bring with them to vote successfully! Don't worry if you've nev
 er written letters to voters before - we'll give you all the tools and in
 fo you need to make letter writing fun and easy.&#160\;This workshop take
 s place in person at the Changemaker Center (12 Washington Place) and&#16
 0\;food is provided for those who attend the full session time.&#160\;** 
 Note on Inclusion and Accessibility: Our events and initiatives are open 
 to all backgrounds and identities. It is a priority to make our events in
 clusive and accessible. For any questions or to notify us of a request\, 
 please email changemakercenter@nyu.edu at least 72 hours before the event
 .**Hosted by: NYU Changemaker CenterAdditional Information can be found a
 t: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12826252 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12
 826252)
