 ards to voters for the upcoming midterm elections! We're partnering with 
 Voteriders\, a nonpartisan organization whose goal is to ensure voters kn
 ow the deadlines for voter registration\, when and where to go to the pol
 ls\, and what they need to bring with them to vote successfully! Don't wo
 rry if you've never written letters to voters before - we'll give you all
  the tools and info you need to make letter writing fun and easy.<br />&#
 160\;<br />This workshop takes place in person at the Changemaker Center 
