SUMMARY:Beginner Yoga with Phil Schuster
DESCRIPTION:https://nyu.zoom.us/j/94097390383 (https://nyu.zoom.us/j/9409
 7390383)&#160\;                                          This class will 
 be flow-based\, with attention to the breath and alignment. We will start
  the practice with Pranayama and build the class through an arc. Moving o
 n to the breath\, building heat and stamina. We will explore some fairly 
 advanced poses to challenge participants and help them feel comfortable m
 oving beyond their comfort zone. The class will end with a restorative po
 se to allow the body to release\, relax\, and reset.                     
                      Located at&#160\;238 Thompson Street (GCASL)\, Room 
 461 [Hybrid]                            &#160\;
