     This class will be flow-based\, with attention to the breath and alig
 nment. We will start the practice with Pranayama and build the class thro
 ugh an arc. Moving on to the breath\, building heat and stamina. We will 
 explore some fairly advanced poses to challenge participants and help the
 m feel comfortable moving beyond their comfort zone. The class will end w
 ith a restorative pose to allow the body to release\, relax\, and reset. 
                    </p><p>                      Located at&#160\;238 Thom
 pson Street (GCASL)\, Room 461 [Hybrid]                    </p></div></di
