SUMMARY:Hand Embellishment + Embroidery with FFG
DESCRIPTION:Come decorate your clothes with Future Fashion Group! Stop by
  to learn about how you can make sustainable and environmentally consciou
 s choices through your personal style and fashion sense. We'll be teachin
 g simple hand-sewing techniques\, embroidery\, and embellishments with al
 l materials provided for free. Bring a garment you've been meaning to rev
 amp OR spruce up a small accessory (canvas totes\, pouches\, pencil cases
 ) available when you swing by. We will have various colors of embroidery 
 thread\, hoops\, mini satin roses\, bows\, buttons\, and more for you to 
 choose from! All provided supplies are limited and available first-come-f
 irst serve. Can't wait to see all of our future fashionistas there!Hosted
  by: Future Fashion Group - All-UniversityAdditional Information can be f
 ound at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12864989 (https://engage.nyu.edu/ev
 ent/12864989)
