SUMMARY:Debate Training: Capitalism vs Socialism
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever had a political debate and didn't know what to 
 say? After attending this training\, we will give you the knowledge and p
 ractice you need to debate with people on free enterprise. We will learn 
 about: Capitalism\, communism\, socialism\, free enterprise\, the failing
 s of socialist countries\, the exceptions\, and why free enterprise is th
 e best way to empower the greatest number of people to pursue happiness a
 nd flourish.Hosted by: Young Americans for Freedom at NYU - All-Universit
 yAdditional Information can be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/128
 48287 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12848287)
