SUMMARY:Aviation Speaker Series: Matthew Hwang\, Summer Intern at Alaska 
 Airlines and Republic Airways
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for an exciting presentation as our Club Preside
 nt\, Matthew Hwang\, speaks about his summer internship experience at Ala
 ska Airlines and Republic Airways and shares his tips and tricks for find
 ing an internship or job in the aviation industry. Matthew was a Data Ana
 lytics Intern at Republic Airways the summer after his Sophomore year\, w
 here he supported the Finance &amp\; Accounting Teams and the LIFT Academ
 y Flight School. This past summer\, he was a Revenue Management intern on
  the North American Pricing Team at Alaska Airlines\, where he priced and
  managed dozens of routes in the SoCal and IntraCal regions. This is an a
 mazing opportunity to hear firsthand how to break into the aviation indus
 try and learn the skills and tools to succeed. You don't want to miss thi
 s! We will have food\, and if you stick around to the end\, we'll be givi
 ng away some model aircraft! Hope to see you there!Hosted by: Aviation Cl
 ub at NYU - All-UniversityAdditional Information can be found at: https:/
 /engage.nyu.edu/event/12837189 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12837189)
