 d tricks for finding an internship or job in the aviation industry. Matth
 ew was a Data Analytics Intern at Republic Airways the summer after his S
 ophomore year\, where he supported the Finance &amp\; Accounting Teams an
 d the LIFT Academy Flight School. This past summer\, he was a Revenue Man
 agement intern on the North American Pricing Team at Alaska Airlines\, wh
 ere he priced and managed dozens of routes in the SoCal and IntraCal regi
 ons. This is an amazing opportunity to hear firsthand how to break into t
 he aviation industry and learn the skills and tools to succeed. You don't
