DESCRIPTION:Stop by the Changemaker Center with any questions about:- How
  to register to vote in the upcoming November 3rd election- What to expec
 t in the voting booth- Where to request an absentee ballot (or send one i
 n)- How to understand your ballot.&#160\;We'll have supplies on hand to p
 repare and mail in your forms. Treat yourself to a delicious bagel while 
 you exercise your democratic rights!&#160\;This workshop takes place in p
 erson at the Changemaker Center (12 Washington Place).&#160\;** Note on I
 nclusion and Accessibility: Our events and initiatives are open to all ba
 ckgrounds and identities. It is a priority to make our events inclusive a
 nd accessible. For any questions or to notify us of a request\, please em
 ail changemakercenter@nyu.edu at least 72 hours before the event.**Hosted
  by: NYU Changemaker Center\, Steinhardt Undergraduate Student Government
 Additional Information can be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/1282
 6188 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12826188)
