SUMMARY:AIChE Meet the Professor: Professor Korley
DESCRIPTION:Meet CBE Professor and Department Chair Dr. LaShanda Korley a
 nd learn about her research at the intersection of bio-inspired design an
 d sustainability.&#160\;Her work uses a bioeconomy framework to design an
 d manufacture functional polymer materials\, from thermoplastics and netw
 orks to composites and gels. She is also the Director of the Center for P
 lastic Innovation at the University of Delaware.&#160\;This is a great op
 portunity to connect with Professor Korley\, hear about her current resea
 rch and career journey\, and ask questions in a casual setting.&#160\;Sna
 cks will be provided!&#160\;Hosted by: American Institute of Chemical Eng
 ineersAdditional Information can be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/even
 t/12814775 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12814775)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Meet CBE Professor and Department Chair Dr. 
 LaShanda Korley and learn about her research at the intersection of bio-i
 nspired design and sustainability.&#160\;Her work uses a bioeconomy frame
 work to design and manufacture functional polymer materials\, from thermo
 plastics and networks to composites and gels. She is also the Director of
  the Center for Plastic Innovation at the University of Delaware.<br />&#
 160\;<br />This is a great opportunity to connect with Professor Korley\,
  hear about her current research and career journey\, and ask questions i
 n a casual setting.<br />&#160\;<br />Snacks will be provided!<br />&#160
 \;<br />Hosted by: American Institute of Chemical Engineers<br />Addition
 al Information can be found at: <a href="https://engage.nyu.edu/event/128
 14775" target="_blank">https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12814775</a>
