SUMMARY:NYU MCG x McKinsey & Company Info Session
DESCRIPTION:MCG is excited to welcome partners and consultants from McKin
 sey's Houston and New York offices for an exclusive info session! Come le
 arn about life at the firm\, what makes McKinsey's culture unique\, and g
 et an inside look at their Oil\, Gas &amp\; Energy practice\, from how th
 ey help clients navigate the energy transition to the kinds of problems c
 onsultants tackle day to day. Whether you're recruiting for consulting or
  just curious about the energy space\, this is a great chance to hear dir
 ectly from the people doing the work and ask your questions. Stick around
  for networking after!&#160\;&#160\;Hosted by: Management Consulting Grou
 pAdditional Information can be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/128
 71759 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12871759)
