SUMMARY:Explore with Chance AI: LES Printshop Tour + Free Boba
DESCRIPTION:Join AStudio on a Chance AI sponsored tour of LES Printshop\,
  a non-profit art organization and studio which helps contemporary artist
 s advance their careers\, for Open House New York weekend. Students will 
 be able to field-test Chance AI while exploring by photographing anything
  that catches their eye\, and using the app as a personal guide to learn 
 more about what they are seeing. Chance Pro access will be provided and C
 hance AI will sponsor free boba t the end of the tour. Attendees are enco
 uraged to provide honest feedback about their experience using the app.&#
 160\;We will meet first in front of the Tisch building and head to the Ga
 rment District together!Hosted by: AStudio at NYUAdditional Information c
 an be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12843258 (https://engage.nyu
 .edu/event/12843258)
