SUMMARY:KNESIS Friday Dance Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join KNESIS every Friday in Kimmel 606 for a weekly K-pop dan
 ce class open to all NYU students! Whether you're an experienced dancer o
 r trying K-pop choreography for the first time\, everyone is welcome—no
  prior dance experience required. We alternate between boy-group and girl
 -group choreography each week\, so there's always something new to learn!
 Classes are limited to 50 participants. Once capacity is reached\, additi
 onal attendees may join an in-person waitlist and will be admitted if spa
 ce becomes available.Follow us on Instagram at @knesisnyu for weekly clas
 s songs\, dance covers\, and club updates.Hosted by: K-Nesis - All-Univer
 sityAdditional Information can be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/
 12819257 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12819257)
