 uphold duties of loyalty and care toward the people they serveThis event 
 is open to all current members of the NYU community. Please RSVP here.Hos
 ted by: NYU AI Safety AssociationAdditional Information can be found at: 
 https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12851583 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12851
 583)
