SUMMARY:Self-Defense Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join Poly Anime Society and the Center for Anti-Violence Educ
 ation for a hands-on self-defense workshop. Learn about situational aware
 ness\; effective stances\, blocks\, and strikes for confrontations\; navi
 gating crowd crush\; and managing physical and emotional well-being after
 wards. Staying safe is essential\, and the best way is to be prepared.&#1
 60\;&#160\;Special goodies await all attendees at the end. Like all of ou
 r events\, this workshop is open to EVERYONE. We encourage you to bring y
 our friends and classmates. Let's support and protect each other!&#160\;D
 ress code: clothes and shoes that are comfortable to move around in.Hoste
 d by: Poly Anime SocietyAdditional Information can be found at: https://e
 ngage.nyu.edu/event/12675143 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12675143)
