SUMMARY:Tien Len Tournament
DESCRIPTION:Join VSA for another event celebrating Vietnamese culture! Ge
 t ready for a fast-paced\, strategic\, and wildly fun card battle at our&
 #160\;Tiến Lên Tournament!&#160\;Whether you're a seasoned player or c
 ompletely new to the game\, this is your chance to experience one of Viet
 nam's most exciting and competitive card games.What is Tiến Lên?Tiến
  Lên&#160\;is a shedding-style card game where quick thinking\, bold pla
 ys\, and clever strategy rule the table. The goal is simple: be the first
  to get rid of all your cards. The challenge? Outsmarting everyone else a
 long the way.Hosted by: Vietnamese Student Association - All-UniversityAd
 ditional Information can be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/128527
 66 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12852766)
