LOCATION:Multiple Locations Across Campus
SUMMARY:Dinner on the Move
DESCRIPTION:Leave your phone at home to connect with friends and colleagu
 es across traditions IRL. We'll share a four-course dinner as we move bet
 ween spiritual spaces on campus\, marked by ritual and conversation. Brin
 g your traditions to the table and join us in the practices that enrich o
 ur campus community and your connections. Close the week with us by makin
 g time for what matters most.  Dinner will be provided. Open to all membe
 rs of the NYU community.&#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Leave your phone at home to connect wit
 h friends and colleagues across traditions IRL. We'll share a four-course
  dinner as we move between spiritual spaces on campus\, marked by ritual 
 and conversation. Bring your traditions to the table and join us in the p
 ractices that enrich our campus community and your connections. Close the
  week with us by making time for what matters most.</p><p>  Dinner will b
 e provided. Open to all members of the NYU community.&#160\;</p>
