SUMMARY:Bridge & Spades Meeting
DESCRIPTION:We are a community of card game lovers that meet regularly on
  Fridays from 6-10 pm. Join us to play (or learn!) Bridge and other card 
 games!We're also one of the largest collegiate bridge clubs in the countr
 y and participate in collegiate tournaments and scrimmages with schools a
 cross North America. Most players join as complete beginners — we run a
  semesterly Introduction to Contract Bridge Course specially focused on t
 eaching new players!Join us on discord:&#160\;https://discord.gg/8bsBsgsD
 FFHosted by: Bridge and Spades - All-UniversityAdditional Information can
  be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12772467 (https://engage.nyu.e
 du/event/12772467)
