SUMMARY:ICC Garba 2026
DESCRIPTION:ICC is thrilled to host our annual NYU Garba Night!Garba is a
  vibrant traditional dance celebrated during the Indian festival of Navra
 tri\, and we are excited to bring this tradition to campus. This event is
  all about uniting our campus community in music\, dance\, and celebratio
 n.The evening will feature catered food\, a photo booth\, lively decorati
 ons\, and endless dancing to capture the true spirit of Garba. Come dress
 ed in your favorite South Asian attire\, bring your friends\, and get rea
 dy for an unforgettable night.We can't wait to see you there!Hosted by: I
 ndian Cultural Club - All-UniversityAdditional Information can be found a
 t: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12815219 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12
 815219)
