SUMMARY:CAC Making Strides Breast Cancer Walk
DESCRIPTION:&#160\;Join the Coalition Against Cancer Sunday\, October 18&
 #160\;to cheer on breast cancer survivors\, thrivers\, previvors and care
 givers at the annual Making Strides of Central Park event! Making Strides
  is the nation's largest and most impactful breast cancer movement - prov
 iding a supportive community for courageous breast cancer survivors and m
 etastatic breast cancer thrivers\, caregivers\, and families alike. The a
 nnual walk around the park raises money for the American Cancer Society.&
 #160\;The walk will take place in Central Park and we will meet up on cam
 pus in front of Kimmel at 7:15 am\, have some donuts and coffee from The 
 Donut Pub\, and then take the subway together to Central Park! We plan on
  arriving at Central Park around 8:00 am for the start of the walk.Hosted
  by: Coalition Against Cancer - All-UniversityAdditional Information can 
 be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12865392 (https://engage.nyu.ed
 u/event/12865392)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:&#160\;<br />Join the Coalition Against Canc
 er Sunday\, October 18&#160\;to cheer on breast cancer survivors\, thrive
 rs\, previvors and caregivers at the annual Making Strides of Central Par
 k event! Making Strides is the nation's largest and most impactful breast
  cancer movement - providing a supportive community for courageous breast
  cancer survivors and metastatic breast cancer thrivers\, caregivers\, an
 d families alike. The annual walk around the park raises money for the Am
 erican Cancer Society.<br />&#160\;<br />The walk will take place in Cent
 ral Park and we will meet up on campus in front of Kimmel at 7:15 am\, ha
 ve some donuts and coffee from The Donut Pub\, and then take the subway t
 ogether to Central Park! We plan on arriving at Central Park around 8:00 
 am for the start of the walk.<br />Hosted by: Coalition Against Cancer - 
 All-University<br />Additional Information can be found at: <a href="http
 s://engage.nyu.edu/event/12865392" target="_blank">https://engage.nyu.edu
 /event/12865392</a>
