LOCATION:Central Park
SUMMARY:Making Strides Against Breast Cancer Walk
DESCRIPTION:On Sunday\, October 18\, NYU Meyers will once again join the 
 American Cancer Society at the annual Making Strides Against Breast Cance
 r Walk in Central Park. Whether you are a student\, alum\, staff or facul
 ty member - join the team! We walk together as a community to raise aware
 ness for breast cancer research &amp\; patient support.P.S. You can also 
 order team merch! Check it out\, and order by Oct 1.https://nursing.nyu.e
