 n Shows\, Paint&#8217\;N&#8217\;Sips\, etc. If you&#8217\;re into making 
 art\, admiring it\, or planning events\, this committee is for you!This y
 ear we&#8217\;re putting on Gallery Night and our fourth annual Fashion S
 how. We&#8217\;d also hoping to put another event on and would love any i
 deas you guys have!To join this club you don&#8217\;t need any experience
 \, portfolio. You don&#8217\;t even need to show up every week! Just show
  up when you can and meet new people. &#551761563680271\; Mondays&#9200\;
  5:30 - 6 pm&#128205\; Kimmel 211Hosted by: NYU Program BoardAdditional I
 nformation can be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12749073 (https:
 //engage.nyu.edu/event/12749073)
