DESCRIPTION:Join us for an interactive cross-cultural conversation inspir
 ed by an NYU Gilman Scholar's study abroad experience in Madrid. Through 
 small-group discussions\, students will explore how culture shapes commun
 ity\, productivity\, social connection\, and everyday life. Attendees wil
 l also learn about the Gilman Scholarship and NYU resources that can help
  make studying abroad more financially accessible\, all while enjoying Sp
 anish food!&#160\;Please RSVP here if you want to attend!&#160\;This is a
  student-led workshop taking place at the Changemaker Center office (12 W
 ashington Place) and&#160\;food will be provided.&#160\;** Note on Inclus
 ion and Accessibility:&#160\;Our events and initiatives are open to all b
 ackgrounds and identities. It is a priority to make our events inclusive 
 and accessible. For any questions or to notify us of a request\, please e
 mail changemakercenter@nyu.edu at least 72 hours before the event.**&#160
