SUMMARY:Quarantines and Removals Due to Sickness: Case Studies
DESCRIPTION:The Medical Humanities and Trauma Studies Working Group invit
 e you to the first event of this semester: "Quarantines and Removals Due 
 to Sickness: Case Studies\," which shall be held on Monday\, October 19th
  from 6 - 7:30 pm in the Room 105 in the English Department (244 Greene S
 treet)! We'll examine case studies drawing from both medical and literary
  archives in order to better understand what led (and leads) to quarantin
 ing\, placement in institutions\, and treatment in place. Food shall be p
 rovided! Looking forward to seeing folks there! Please RSVP here (https:/
 /urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__docs.google.com_forms_d_e_1
