SUMMARY:Aux Wars
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to put your music knowledge to the test at Cultural
  AUX Wars &amp\; Karaoke! &#127926\;&#127757\; Bring your favorite songs\
 , artists\, and sounds from all over the African Diaspora and battle it o
 ut to see who really controls the aux. Then grab the mic and show us what
  you've got! Come sing\, dance\, compete\, and celebrate the music that b
 rings our cultures together. All students are welcome!Hosted by: African 
 Students Union - All-University\, Alpha Phi Alpha Fraternity\, Inc. - All
 -University\, Black Student Union - All-University\, Caribbean Students A
 ssociation - All-UniversityAdditional Information can be found at: https:
 //engage.nyu.edu/event/12788311 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12788311)
