SUMMARY:Monday Small Group
DESCRIPTION:Each Monday we gather in a relaxed setting with snacks\, fun 
 games\, and meaningful Bible study. We start by hanging out\, having snac
 ks and playing a few lighthearted games to build community\, and then div
 e into Scripture through open discussion\, reflection\, and prayer. It's 
 a place where questions are welcome\, friendships deepen\, and faith beco
 mes personal. Whether you've been walking with God for years or you're ju
 st curious\, small group is a space to belong.Hosted by: Asian American C
 hristian Fellowship - All-UniversityAdditional Information can be found a
 t: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12772324 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12
 772324)
