SUMMARY:NYURI Percussion Practice
DESCRIPTION:Join NYURI for our weekly practice session!As NYC's only stud
 ent organization dedicated to the art of Korean percussion\, we are passi
 onate about sharing this unique art form with the NYU community.At this m
 eeting\, you will learn everything about the Janggu\, the iconic Korean h
 ourglass drum\, from playing posture and striking techniques to the funda
 mental rhythms that drive Korean music.Prior experience in music or Korea
 n culture is not required as our members will be providing comprehensive 
 instruction for all beginners.All instruments are provided. All you need 
 to do is walk in!This week we will be meeting in Kimmel Room 604!Hosted b
 y: Rhythmic Impulse at NYU - All-UniversityAdditional Information can be 
 found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12819124 (https://engage.nyu.edu/e
 vent/12819124)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Join NYURI for our weekly practice session!<
 br />As NYC's only student organization dedicated to the art of Korean pe
 rcussion\, we are passionate about sharing this unique art form with the 
 NYU community.<br />At this meeting\, you will learn everything about the
  Janggu\, the iconic Korean hourglass drum\, from playing posture and str
 iking techniques to the fundamental rhythms that drive Korean music.<br /
 >Prior experience in music or Korean culture is not required as our membe
 rs will be providing comprehensive instruction for all beginners.<br />Al
 l instruments are provided. All you need to do is walk in!<br />This week
  we will be meeting in Kimmel Room 604!<br />Hosted by: Rhythmic Impulse 
 at NYU - All-University<br />Additional Information can be found at: <a h
 ref="https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12819124" target="_blank">https://engag
 e.nyu.edu/event/12819124</a>
