SUMMARY:General Meeting
DESCRIPTION:These meeting will recur each monday for our chapter to meet 
 and discuss prevalent medical topics in our society today\, plan and host
  fundraising events and charity drives\, and further our members learning
  in the medical field. We will also host workshops and events open to the
  broader NYU community focusing on the transition to medical school\, dis
 cussing topics such as how to apply to medical school\, MCAT resources\, 
 and interview prep.&#160\;Hosted by: Phi Delta EpsilonAdditional Informat
 ion can be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12660940 (https://engag
 e.nyu.edu/event/12660940)
