SUMMARY:Open House for M.A. in Historical and Sustainable Architecture
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a future path? Love old buildings? Why not make t
 hem new again? NYU's London and Paris-based M.A. Program provides an imme
 rsion in adaptive reuse and sustainable building practice. Come learn abo
 ut the program at our Open House\, featuring presentations about our facu
 lty and curriculum\, admissions information for 2027-28\, and a discussio
 n of career opportunities in the field. Program directors\, faculty\, and
  alumni will join us to discuss the program and answer your questions. Ap
 plications for 2027-28 are due March 1\, 2027.  If you wish to join remot
 ely\, please use this zoom link: https://nyu.zoom.us/j/6362243344 (https:
 //nyu.zoom.us/j/6362243344)  If you wish to join us in-person but do not 
 hold a current NYU ID\, please register here for building access. We will
  send you an access email before the event. https://forms.gle/WFRpaZYHZW2
 ssUd56 (https://forms.gle/WFRpaZYHZW2ssUd56)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p style="font-weight: 400\;">  Looking for 
 a future path? Love old buildings? Why not make them new again? NYU's Lon
 don and Paris-based M.A. Program provides an immersion in adaptive reuse 
 and sustainable building practice. Come learn about the program at our Op
 en House\, featuring presentations about our faculty and curriculum\, adm
 issions information for 2027-28\, and a discussion of career opportunitie
 s in the field. Program directors\, faculty\, and alumni will join us to 
 discuss the program and answer your questions. Applications for 2027-28 a
 re due March 1\, 2027.</p><p style="font-weight: 400\;">  If you wish to 
 join remotely\, please use this zoom link: <a href="https://nyu.zoom.us/j
 /6362243344">https://nyu.zoom.us/j/6362243344</a></p><p style="font-weigh
 t: 400\;">  If you wish to join us in-person but do not hold a current NY
 U ID\, please register here for building access. We will send you an acce
 ss email before the event. <a href="https://forms.gle/WFRpaZYHZW2ssUd56">
 https://forms.gle/WFRpaZYHZW2ssUd56</a></p>
