SUMMARY:Health Equity Panel: Culturally Responsive Care for Indigenous Co
 mmunities in NYC
DESCRIPTION:Join LINEN at NYU School of Global Public Health for a virtua
 l Health Equity Panel featuring a representative from the New York Indian
  Council\, Inc.This student-centered conversation will explore culturally
