SUMMARY:AMC Member Engagement Pickleball Clinic
DESCRIPTION:This event is open to NYU administrators only.    &#160\;    
   The Administrative Management Council (AMC) Member Engagement Committee
  invites you to a Pickleball Social on October 20th.      Join us for a f
 un\, energetic afternoon on the courts of the Paulson Center. Whether you
 've never held a paddle before or you're a seasoned dinker\, this event i
 s all about having fun\, connecting with colleagues\, and enjoying some f
 riendly competition!  Event Details    Date: Tuesday\, October 20    Time
 : 4pm - 5:30pm    Location: Paulson Center Gymnasium (lower level)    Ope
 n to all administrators (zero experience required)  What to Expect    - A
 ll Skill Levels Welcome: Beginners can take part in a 5 minute tutorial b
 efore gameplay starts    - Format: Casual Round-Robin Play (switch partne
 rs each round) so all can enjoy    - Equipment: Paddles and balls will be
  provided\, but we encourage you to bring your own paddles if you have th
 em!    - Refreshments: Water will be provided\, and light prepackaged sna
 cks  What to Bring    - Comfortable attire    - Sneakers / court shoes (n
 on-streaking)    - Your enthusiasm!      Ready to play? Register now to s
 ecure your spot! (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeSUIk3pH9DDQ8
 19ApUzceLpOkKl_oH94l2RlGn6A4_c0xRpg/viewform) (Space is limited.)
