SUMMARY:EAS Creative Workshop: Snow Globe Cups
DESCRIPTION:Get creative and design a personalized snow globe cup at EAS 
 Creative Workshop: Snow Globe Cups\, a&#160\;hands-on arts and crafts wor
 kshop hosted by the Department of East Asian Studies! Participants will h
 ave the opportunity to customize their own cups using a variety of sticke
 rs\, decorative inserts\, and special effects\, including colorful lava l
 amp and soda sizzle designs. Whether you prefer a minimalist look or a bo
 ld\, eye-catching creation\, this workshop offers a fun and relaxing spac
 e to express your creativity.No prior crafting experience is required—a
 ll materials will be provided. Come connect with fellow students\, unwind
  from the demands of the semester\, and leave with a unique handmade cup 
 to take home. We look forward to creating with you!Hosted by: Department 
 of East Asian StudiesAdditional Information can be found at: https://enga
 ge.nyu.edu/event/12481210 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12481210)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Get creative and design a personalized snow 
 globe cup at EAS Creative Workshop: Snow Globe Cups\, a&#160\;hands-on ar
 ts and crafts workshop hosted by the Department of East Asian Studies! Pa
 rticipants will have the opportunity to customize their own cups using a 
 variety of stickers\, decorative inserts\, and special effects\, includin
 g colorful lava lamp and soda sizzle designs. Whether you prefer a minima
 list look or a bold\, eye-catching creation\, this workshop offers a fun 
 and relaxing space to express your creativity.<br />No prior crafting exp
 erience is required—all materials will be provided. Come connect with f
 ellow students\, unwind from the demands of the semester\, and leave with
  a unique handmade cup to take home. We look forward to creating with you
 !<br />Hosted by: Department of East Asian Studies<br />Additional Inform
 ation can be found at: <a href="https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12481210" ta
 rget="_blank">https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12481210</a>
