 have the opportunity to learn the basics of wheel throwing\, shape clay\,
  and bring home your very own one-of-a-kind piece! No experience necessar
 y.Hosted by: CAS Second Year ExperienceAdditional Information can be foun
 d at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12853132 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event
 /12853132)
