SUMMARY:MCC PhD Panel
DESCRIPTION:The SAMM PhD Panel is an informational and conversational eve
 nt for MCC students who are considering a PhD or are curious about doctor
 al study and academic careers. MCC professors and current PhD students/ca
 ndidates will share their experiences with PhD applications\, research\, 
 academic life\, funding\, career paths\, work-life balance\, and navigati
 ng uncertainty throughout graduate study. Students will also have an oppo
 rtunity to ask panelists their own questions during an open Q&amp\;A.Host
 ed by: Student Association for the Master's in MediaAdditional Informatio
 n can be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12854821 (https://engage.
 nyu.edu/event/12854821)
