 imal Protection\, speaks on the rights of animals and how animal exploita
 tion affects the environment and public health. Dr. Faraz speaks on his j
 ourney in leaving Iran\, his work as a biomedical researcher in alt prote
 ins\, and his journey to founding the largest student animal advocacy gro
 up in the country. Plant-based food will be provided.Hosted by: Animal Ri
 ghts Collective - All-UniversityAdditional Information can be found at: h
 ttps://engage.nyu.edu/event/12812377 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/128123
 77)
