SUMMARY:After the Revolution
DESCRIPTION:After the Revolution by Amy Herzog\, directed by Nelson T. Eu
 sebio III. The brilliant\, promising Emma Joseph proudly carries the torc
 h of her family's Marxist tradition\, devoting her life to the memory of 
 her blacklisted grandfather. But when history reveals a shocking truth ab
 out the man himself\, the entire family is forced to confront questions o
 f honesty and allegiance they thought had been resolved.
