SUMMARY:STEM Research Communication: How to Build and Present a Research 
 Poster
DESCRIPTION:This workshop is designed for STEM graduate students or upper
  level undergraduates interested in engaging with STEM research.In this w
 orkshop\, we will discuss the various means of scientific communication\,
  share best practices for data visualization to building your very own po
 ster\, and build out presentation skills. This session will be offered in
 -person and on Zoom\, but we highly recommend in-person attendance.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:This workshop is designed for STEM graduate 
 students or upper level undergraduates interested in engaging with STEM r
 esearch.<br />In this workshop\, we will discuss the various means of sci
 entific communication\, share best practices for data visualization to bu
 ilding your very own poster\, and build out presentation skills. This ses
 sion will be offered in-person and on Zoom\, but we highly recommend in-p
 erson attendance.
