SUMMARY:Panel with Professionals in Global Affairs Journalism
DESCRIPTION:Join IR Insider\, co-hosted by the International Relations So
 ciety\, for a panel with professionals in global affairs journalism. Spea
 kers John Haltiwanger\, Mohamad Rimawi\, Hanna Davis\, Suhani Lakhotia\, 
 and Suha Musa have worked or contributed across outlets including FP\, Bl
 oomberg\, Al Jazeera English\, GZERO Media\, and CNN.The moderated discus
 sion will cover their backgrounds\, their pathways into journalism\, the 
 skills and tips they wish they'd learned earlier\, and the role undergrad
 uate publications played in their careers. The panel will be followed by 
 an audience Q&amp\;A session. A great opportunity for anyone interested i
 n journalism\, writing\, or global affairs\, and a chance to meet other s
 tudents who share those interests.Dress Code: Business ProfessionalHosted
  by: International Relations SocietyAdditional Information can be found a
 t: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12866008 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12
 866008)
