SUMMARY:Entrepreneurship Kick-off Event
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an interactive eEntrepreneurship Interest and Bra
 instorming Session to kick off the academic year! We'll explore different
  pathways in entrepreneurship\, including startups\, social entrepreneurs
 hip\, consulting\, and innovation within established companies. Through a
 n engaging brainstorming activity\, you'll have the opportunity to share 
 your ideas\, pitch potential solutions to real-world problems\, and conne
 ct with fellow students who share your interests. Whether you already hav
 e a business idea or are simply curious about entrepreneurship\, this ses
 sion is a chance to get creative\, collaborate\, and explore opportunitie
 s to turn your ideas into action.Hosted by: National Society of Black Eng
 ineersAdditional Information can be found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/even
 t/12857368 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12857368)
