LOCATION:Kimmel gcasl room 388
SUMMARY:Thursday Small Group
DESCRIPTION:Each Thursday we gather in a relaxed setting with snacks\, fu
 n games\, and meaningful Bible study. We start by hanging out\, having sn
 acks and playing a few lighthearted games to build community\, and then d
 ive into Scripture through open discussion\, reflection\, and prayer. It'
 s a place where questions are welcome\, friendships deepen\, and faith be
 comes personal. Whether you've been walking with God for years or you're 
 just curious\, small group is a space to belong.Hosted by: Asian American
  Christian Fellowship - All-UniversityAdditional Information can be found
  at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12772215 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/
 12772215)
