LOCATION:The Shubert Theatre<br />\nADDRESS:721 Broadway 5th Floor New Yo
 rk\, NY 10003
SUMMARY:Landscape of the Body
DESCRIPTION:Landscape of the Body by John Guare directed by Andreas Andre
 ou.   Landscape of the Body tells the story of a woman's unfulfilled life
  and premature death—and her reflections from the grave. Moving back an
 d forth in time through a mosaic of short scenes\, monologues and origina
 l songs\, we witness what happens when the American dream goes awry.
UID:20261022T230000Z-407803@events.nyu.edu
DTSTAMP:20261007T111651Z
