LOCATION:Online
SUMMARY:Writing a Grant Proposal in the Intervention Optimization Paradig
 m: K Mechanisms
DESCRIPTION:In this practical workshop\, participants will learn what is 
 needed to write a proposal for a K grant involving intervention optimizat
 ion\, including analytic approach (e.g.\, DAIVE\, outcomes\, value functi
 on). Attendees will be provided examples from successful K applications a
 nd receive individualized grant writing tips from experts working in the 
 intervention optimization paradigm. Participants who complete the grant p
 roposal writing workshop have the opportunity to receive individualized\,
  detailed feedback on their aims by course instructors.https://publicheal
 th.nyu.edu/events-news/events/2026/10/23/writing-grant-proposal-intervent
 ion-optimization-paradigm-k (https://publichealth.nyu.edu/events-news/eve
 nts/2026/10/23/writing-grant-proposal-intervention-optimization-paradigm-
 k)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:In this practical workshop\, participants wi
 ll learn what is needed to write a proposal for a K grant involving inter
 vention optimization\, including analytic approach (e.g.\, DAIVE\, outcom
 es\, value function). Attendees will be provided examples from successful
  K applications and receive individualized grant writing tips from expert
 s working in the intervention optimization paradigm. Participants who com
 plete the grant proposal writing workshop have the opportunity to receive
  individualized\, detailed feedback on their aims by course instructors.<
