BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T133000
SUMMARY:Understanding NYC Public Middle School Admissions with NYC Admiss
 ions Solutions
DESCRIPTION:Transitioning to middle school is a significant academic and 
 social milestone\, and figuring out what to prioritize in the NYC Public 
 Schools admissions process can be complex. Work Life is partnering with M
 aurice Frumkin\, President of NYC Admissions Solutions (NYC%20Admissions%
 20Solutions) and former NYC DOE Deputy Executive Director of High School 
 Enrollment\, to help 4th and 5th-grade families build a balanced\, right-
 fit application list for Fall 2027 entry. Gain clear strategies\, insider
  clarity\, and actionable next steps directly from an expert.  Session Hi
 ghlights:  - Process &amp\; Timeline: Key updates for 2027\, deadlines\, 
 and details about screened schools.  - Essential Resources: Where to find
  the most accurate information and how to use it effectively.  - Recommen
 ded Next Steps: Practical strategies for organizing school tours\, prepar
 ing for assessments\, and building your application list.&#160\;About the
  Speaker: Maurice Frumkin brings nearly two decades of experience as a fo
 rmer NYC DOE enrollment director\, private school admissions officer\, an
 d educator. An alumnus of Penn and NYU Stern\, Maurice has spent his care
 er helping families successfully navigate complex school choice decisions
  with confidence.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Transitioning to middle school is a sig
 nificant academic and social milestone\, and figuring out what to priorit
 ize in the NYC Public Schools admissions process can be complex. Work Lif
 e is partnering with Maurice Frumkin\, President of <a href="NYC%20Admiss
 ions%20Solutions">NYC Admissions Solutions</a> and former NYC DOE Deputy 
 Executive Director of High School Enrollment\, to help 4th and 5th-grade 
 families build a balanced\, right-fit application list for Fall 2027 entr
 y. Gain clear strategies\, insider clarity\, and actionable next steps di
 rectly from an expert.</p><p>  Session Highlights:<br />  - Process &amp\
 ; Timeline: Key updates for 2027\, deadlines\, and details about screened
  schools.<br />  - Essential Resources: Where to find the most accurate i
 nformation and how to use it effectively.<br />  - Recommended Next Steps
 : Practical strategies for organizing school tours\, preparing for assess
 ments\, and building your application list.&#160\;</p><p><strong>About th
 e Speaker:</strong> Maurice Frumkin brings nearly two decades of experien
 ce as a former NYC DOE enrollment director\, private school admissions of
 ficer\, and educator. An alumnus of Penn and NYU Stern\, Maurice has spen
 t his career helping families successfully navigate complex school choice
  decisions with confidence.</p>
