SUMMARY:Cosplay Prop Workshop 2
DESCRIPTION:It's part two of our Cosplay Workshop series and the EVA foam
  is hitting the cutting mats~&#160\;Receive your custom crafting material
 s and get the tools you need to begin construction of your prop! We'll go
  over how to shape EVA foam\, create supports\, 3D print\, prep a base fo
 r paint\, and recognize which materials or methods work best for which si
 tuations. Each cosplayer will be given individual instruction for their p
 roject on top of group demonstrations.&#160\;&#160\;Cosplayers continuing
  from the first workshop will jump straight into bringing their sketches 
 to life\, and newcomers will get a quick onboarding to join the class and
  use available materials. No design or building experience necessary!&#16
 0\;&#160\;For any questions\, please email us at nyupolyotaku@gmail.com.&
 #160\;Hosted by: Poly Anime SocietyAdditional Information can be found at
 : https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12675101 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/126
 75101)
