SUMMARY:Weekly TGC Locals!
DESCRIPTION:Join us in this offline weekly series where competitors parti
 cipate in a double elimination FT2 bracket. Every week we will run Smash 
 Ultimate and usually a fighting game bracket. Feel free to bring any kind
  of video game you want\, we'd be happy to have you. Make sure to join th
 e discord to see where the event will be but it will most likely be at 6 
 Metrotech Center room 201. Bracket starts at 7PM.(https://discord.gg/kkuG
 2qZX9S)Hosted by: The Gaming Collective @NYUAdditional Information can be
  found at: https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12857892 (https://engage.nyu.edu/
 event/12857892)
