SUMMARY:Urban Forest Foray
DESCRIPTION:NYU's Urban Naturalist and Mycology Group are joining forces 
 to give you a fall Urban Forest Foray hosted by Mycology Group President\
 , Alexa Calderon and Vice President\, Wendy Liu along with Urban Naturali
 st President\, Terry Chang! As temperatures cool\, but humidity remains\,
  we can observe the last fungi available for the year AND identify native
  species [did you know there are salamanders in NYC?!]We'll chat about wh
 at we find\, as well as the health\, safety\, and ethics of observing nat
 ure. Both clubs will give their respective knowledge in the areas that co
 ncern them.Mycology will be providing copies of&#160\;Mushrooms of the No
 rtheast: A Simple Guide to Common Mushrooms (Mushroom Guides). Urban Natu
 ralists will provide binoculars!The purpose of this event is only to educ
 ate members on the nature around them.&#160\;Urban Naturalist Club and My
 cology Group are not responsible for any medical issues arising from memb
 ers ingesting any species picked from NYC Parks to their own accord.Hoste
 d by: Mycology Group at NYU - All-University\, Urban Naturalist Club at N
 YU - All-UniversityAdditional Information can be found at: https://engage
 .nyu.edu/event/12805095 (https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12805095)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:NYU's Urban Naturalist and Mycology Group ar
 e joining forces to give you a fall Urban Forest Foray hosted by Mycology
  Group President\, Alexa Calderon and Vice President\, Wendy Liu along wi
 th Urban Naturalist President\, Terry Chang! As temperatures cool\, but h
 umidity remains\, we can observe the last fungi available for the year AN
 D identify native species [did you know there are salamanders in NYC?!]<b
 r />We'll chat about what we find\, as well as the health\, safety\, and 
 ethics of observing nature. Both clubs will give their respective knowled
 ge in the areas that concern them.<br />Mycology will be providing copies
  of&#160\;Mushrooms of the Northeast: A Simple Guide to Common Mushrooms 
 (Mushroom Guides). Urban Naturalists will provide binoculars!<br />The pu
 rpose of this event is only to educate members on the nature around them.
 &#160\;Urban Naturalist Club and Mycology Group are not responsible for a
 ny medical issues arising from members ingesting any species picked from 
 NYC Parks to their own accord.<br />Hosted by: Mycology Group at NYU - Al
 l-University\, Urban Naturalist Club at NYU - All-University<br />Additio
 nal Information can be found at: <a href="https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12
 805095" target="_blank">https://engage.nyu.edu/event/12805095</a>
