 dent_hub.rev.1756228838.png
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:407308
X-NYU-BRIEFING:What to Brin
 g: Comfortable sneakers you can bike\, climb and slide in\, warm layers (
 it’s windier and colder on the harbor than in the city)\, a reusable to
 te bag for your pumpkin\, a card or cash for lunch\, snacks and optional 
 bike rentals\, and an umbrella or raincoat if rain is in the forecast.
